{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ee801b948c0bddd7f87b276e4c0478bec7fc970f856df32659c427529dcbb123", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまでーすっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦你了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e328b4a844c8f2feb389082806c1d067419ee03fb54162d3d68bb5307876d2a2", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nなんだか、元気いっぱいですね？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n总觉得你今天充满活力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e94f46c0b2e0d1f87618d960bac60ece1c81dc3c9bf804b12633ff2e9b9aed76", "ja": "はい！　この前のお休みに帰省して、\nしっかりリフレッシュしてきましたから♪", "zh": "是的！因为前阵子放假我回老家，\n好好放松了一番♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c4a447ee4719822a9ba3437be5c5eabc1bcb59d3dec6ef416e710d6f735757a8", "ja": "あ、これ、よかったらどうぞ。\n種子島土産の、宇宙食です♪", "zh": "啊，不嫌弃的话请收下这个，\n是种子岛的名产──太空食品♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1004", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1047_p", "source_sha256": "16c6d4977bf5320cd3b69527eec51e4dd3bd43aa50a1bd060c874baef407c914", "ja": "いいんですか？　ありがとうございます。\n宇宙食か……どんな味がするんだろう。", "zh": "我真的可以收下吗？谢谢你。\n太空食品啊……不知道吃起来是什么味道呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "d0b78be353458d7ca45d00204c26aa651b89f7ca3dd6bcaa1f1b00888fa74276", "ja": "宇宙食って、食感が面白いんですよ！\n宇宙の味、楽しんでくださいね♪", "zh": "太空食品的口感很有趣喔！\n请享用太空的滋味吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "26822be4b22156ba16efeaa55dcaac22610340e1377c8773a31d5653fc86ad67", "ja": "わかりました。\nこのお礼は、近い内に必ずしますね。", "zh": "好的，\n我一定会尽快给你回礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "d22e4228ff54bb439abec8cf14ed2eb19cd1f28ceb7fc2877ac875fcc971cde9", "ja": "そんなのいいですよ～！\nけど、ありがとうございます。えへへ。", "zh": "不用客气啦～！\n但还是谢谢你了，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "a05a4023dbc1232dae6dd32723e7335d08c980416f5f6b6e6c354c326f85b5da", "ja": "そうそう。そういえば社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんのこと呼んでいましたよ。", "zh": "对了对了，话说回来，\n社长在找{$P$}先生喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "db0bae7b7a35b42e3ff2c0121a70610bcb1205ad99d83bed648a748447e74c08", "ja": "そうですか。\nじゃあ、事務所の方に行ってきます！", "zh": "这样啊。\n那我去事务所一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "677c436b03b8e3ae95a2f4e5d82603d1826f4136c858d6df28907f8a5eee8015", "ja": "はーい！　行ってらっしゃーい♪\n今年もみんなと一緒に、がんばりましょうね～！", "zh": "好的～！请慢走～♪\n今年也和大家一起加油吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "43d8fad22ddb6ec496c4696e5de6d1ae03d995cd3a250a9952060746c50ede63", "ja": "なんと！？　満貫直撃とは！\nうーむ……よし、もう一局だ！", "zh": "什么！？竟然是满贯直击！\n唔唔……好，再来一局！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "d6719efabeaf53bc28fc8f5605fc4207ca2e5b18b6bbfc663172109d51b5ba94", "ja": "社長、そろそろ仕事に戻ったほうが……。", "zh": "社长，差不多该回去工作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "b64237e5ebbe330659e4ae47b15b8451f9fbd6e3871942240e4fc8c996f2014f", "ja": "よし、リーチ！\nどうだね音無君、これなら……。", "zh": "好，听牌！\n怎么样？音无，这么一来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "906543b1eacb0b7e83d818ea1de3111b850f16611ae446d6e6649c9841e77ff2", "ja": "社長、よく見てください。", "zh": "社长，请看清楚一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "2b72728677125f5b6d1aec8e00962c2ed518e4556cae7a74f1bbf913dbc3d3f9", "ja": "むう！？　なんと、まさかここに来て、\n先にツモられてしまうとは……いやはや、完敗だ……。", "zh": "嗯！？都打到这一步了，\n竟然会让对手自摸……唉呀，真是输惨了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3f3f16d3b400062e6b26519a995a53f94f11767c459a8c59b6900bda297f6901", "ja": "おはようございます！\nあの、社長。何をしているんですか……？", "zh": "早安！\n那个，社长，请问你在做什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "b8c072076e47d3d76cf25ef162b8d83d7424811ad3d7a11b75229a5b9b328c7e", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん。\n社長、インターネットの麻雀にはまってしまって……。", "zh": "早安，{$P$}先生。\n社长最近迷上了线上麻将……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "d11b730694f08a3723c8f2fb6d8d39d04159e71fe2c5b9f0befe59bfebb82d0b", "ja": "ちょうど今、対局が終わったところだよ。\nいやはや、最下位になってしまうとは……。", "zh": "我刚刚正好打完一局。\n伤脑筋，没想到会吊车尾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "db8c2dc750d76b0da7b3b7cc9baa828d6708c7f117f31a933a444b8ef11bb011", "ja": "若い頃はこれでもなかなか強かったのだがね。\nすっかり、腕が鈍ってしまったようだ。", "zh": "别看我这样，年轻时还是挺强的啊。\n看来现在技术都生疏了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "bd20d68ee2f3e109e4d3630e707e82af0bae5d2a69088a1a0c2a15f89ed9414b", "ja": "ちなみに、1位はこのみさんでした。", "zh": "顺带一提，第一名是木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "270f351fd5305acd83efde16cfe200d6b4c267e6b91075d4303b397bb3391f59", "ja": "アイドル達と対戦してたんですか。\nというか、このみさん、強いんですね……。", "zh": "原来是在跟偶像们对战吗？\n重点是木实还真强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "706bc38e90a3115f7089038d4fe9d429e1ef7c6c1c9fa85316dc15eec7305232", "ja": "ところで、今日来てもらったのは他でもない。\n君に、新しい曲を渡そうと思ってね。", "zh": "话说回来，今天请你来这里不为别的。\n我打算把新歌交给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "74b038be414f4999ad24bf2bababd0dd3b9736d1652584cfd6b923b463a419c2", "ja": "まずは、このデモテープを聞いてくれたまえ……。\n音無君、ミュージック、スタートだ！", "zh": "你先听听这卷试听带……\n音无，Music start！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "d84325f719b28bcbcaa98c0bf4e965ff7a1f89ac855c16df9c6a5a5ddbe3c0f6", "ja": "はい、社長！\n再生ボタンを……ポチッ。", "zh": "是的，社长！\n播放键……（按下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1940b5b880408499255a3384138ba65c54d433c1c41835b621a321906f80b508", "ja": "これは、なかなか……\n女性ファンも喜びそうな、いい感じの曲ですね？", "zh": "这还真是……\n这首歌感觉很不错，女性粉丝应该也会喜欢呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "a9cf4d6672c98ac2561fe9af45dd38bdb304ac35f22bcf9bc04f09483b2292c7", "ja": "ふふふ、そうだろう？　君には、この曲にピッタリな\nアイドル諸君で、ユニットを組んでもらいたい。", "zh": "呵呵呵，不错吧？我希望你能挑选\n适合这首歌的偶像，组成一个团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "9d2a8769e2372592d0f12e06879b4d0a65e28841c45b4831f3aee7cdc1651154", "ja": "ちなみに……今曲を聞いてみた段階で、\nどんなユニットにするか、アイディアはあるかね？", "zh": "话说……目前试听了这首歌，\n你打算组成什么样的团体？有什么点子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a84d5c976dc7936a08aec716d5a91a54fd4e22d9a9e2b389fd98171683c57987", "ja": "そうですね。曲の雰囲気から考えて、\nお姫様っぽい感じのユニットとかどうでしょうか。", "zh": "这个嘛，考虑到歌曲的氛围，\n组成有公主气息的团体怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "5c5006f1745a15a96c9a1ac6ca450159c2f3467bbed65a9f519c407f6283b352", "ja": "あまり、大人数ではなく……\n可愛らしいけど、しっとりした雰囲気で……。", "zh": "人数稍微少一点……\n除了可爱之外，同时又有一种娴静端庄的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "04fa72a0ad6b4af3ae9ee7e766195ad5b64652b378544248696a8872025c67fe", "ja": "お姫様！？　素敵なコンセプトじゃないですか！\n小さい頃は、お姫様になるのが夢だったっけ……。", "zh": "公主！？这主题很棒呢！\n记得我小时候的梦想是当公主……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "e0dfe228b33f064de096ea2f82a4055a33c3d057d11517e2e73b329b1584cd32", "ja": "音無さんもですか？\n子どもらしくてかわいい、素敵な夢ですね。", "zh": "音无小姐也是吗？\n这真是充满童趣又可爱，是很棒的梦想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "f9c206f7d7f5386aba659e6c6ba1d10b7baea1cca8c3d115747142729aad48e4", "ja": "うふふっ、そうですか？　よく、自分がお姫様になった\n妄想をしてました。そう、こんな感じで……。", "zh": "呵呵，是吗？我以前常常幻想自己是公主。\n没错，就像这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1036_101kot", "source_sha256": "22230f81c63b07b1e94cf65cdfc469af4e5bf6339c0cf81ee24c9b60d7c28bad", "ja": "『小鳥姫、ボクと結婚してほしい！』", "zh": "『小鸟公主，请你和我结婚！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1037_101kot", "source_sha256": "9edd865b9a5effc9b3665ba785f51b706625c98050a26a5dd2e35d739245718e", "ja": "『はい、白馬の王子様！』", "zh": "『好的，白马王子！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1038_101kot", "source_sha256": "86752bef8001b3462f67ef730aa74cfcd81721d7b14835d42955166b4aebdbe7", "ja": "『待て！』", "zh": "『等等！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1039_101kot", "source_sha256": "ed056b06768004c1a0eb1c54ec5e2aa21689445ee3dfea84efd24d0f0d5e0ac8", "ja": "『はっ！？　貴方は……黒馬の王子様！』", "zh": "『什么！？你是……黑马王子！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1040_101kot", "source_sha256": "e01eecb96f14a1f22bd0169a4da40d3aa486dcfcfee6e647a0a3fa46e4fef702", "ja": "『小鳥と結婚するのはこのオレだ！\nどうしてもと言うなら、オレと勝負しろ！』", "zh": "『小鸟结婚的对象是我才对！\n如果你这么坚持，就和我决斗吧！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1041_101kot", "source_sha256": "67e898547bec9e9ff34ee384f17b08a08789f2f3aacdcb708427648aa4dfce64", "ja": "そして小鳥姫をめぐって、王子と王子の決闘が始まる！\nああっ、やめてっ！　私のために争わないで～！", "zh": "然后王子和王子为了争夺小鸟公主的决斗就此展开！\n啊啊，不要这样！不要为了我打架～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1044_101kot", "source_sha256": "bd3733527a9f5438b2c6639a044e72205af44bd811393fbc089a45a997c652cd", "ja": "はっ！？\nこ、子どもの頃の話ですよ！　子どもの頃の！", "zh": "啊！？\n这、这是我小时候的事喔！小时候啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1045_p", "source_sha256": "d77d076881fe74806c1f1ac1be850cf16d8c0efa9d46cf7008ce2228e7ab0b1a", "ja": "（……音無さんも、期待してくれているみたいだな！）", "zh": "（……音无小姐似乎也很期待呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_intro_1046_p", "source_sha256": "cf029b27c9ad3abb0bb82f1183f192fae6784b7c7d1f36d392fefa348c8e83f4", "ja": "（さて、メンバーは誰にしようか。\n俺も妄想……いや、想像力を働かせないと！）", "zh": "（那要找哪些成员来演唱呢？\n我也要好好发挥妄想……不，是想像力了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
